### `333 service install`: whether the program a service would run is still there tomorrow.

service-exe-asking = 正在询问系统这个程序在哪里

service-exe-fleeting = 这个程序从 { $exe } 运行，那是{ $why }。指向它的服务会在它消失
    的那天停止。把它复制到 { $home }，从那里运行 `service install`。

service-exe-emptied = 系统会清空的目录
service-exe-build-directory = 构建目录，下次构建会替换它
